WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.249
- Was that uncomfortable
though, being in that mask?

00:00:01.249 --> 00:00:03.340
That was huge.

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:04.173
- What?

00:00:04.173 --> 00:00:05.006
- Were you hot?

00:00:05.006 --> 00:00:05.839
I would be sweating.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:06.672
- I was hot as hell, yes.

00:00:06.672 --> 00:00:08.270
It was like, so hot,

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:11.900
so kind of uncomfortable but
I wanted to be in that mask

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:14.370
and I wanted to be in that hard dress

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:15.530
and those pumps.

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:17.530
- Man, you are braver than I,

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:20.000
I look at my stylus, I'm
like, I feel like sausage,

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.790
I feel like I'm stuffed in
here, help me out, I'm like..

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:25.837
No but my sister and my
mother love that show.

00:00:25.837 --> 00:00:28.430
- It's an awesome show.

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:30.400
- It's so big, it's so popular.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:33.660
- Yes it is and I'm happy
to have been a part of it.

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:36.300
At 75, I do think that people don't think

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.782
75 women should do that.

00:00:37.782 --> 00:00:39.056
- Did you say 75?

00:00:39.056 --> 00:00:42.973
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:00:44.293 --> 00:00:45.257
- [Guest] Oh yes.

00:00:45.257 --> 00:00:48.266
- I have zero time for you
lookin' like that at 75.

00:00:48.266 --> 00:00:49.475
- Oh thanks sweetheart.

00:00:49.475 --> 00:00:50.808
- I can't stand you right now.

